</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>While your arms can turn a rope</l><l>And can throw a ball,</l><l>Remember, remember,</l><l>Remember God made you.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>While your ears hear chirping birds</l><l>And quacking ducks,</l><l>Remember, remember,</l><l>Remember God made you.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>While your eyes see butterflies</l><l>And tiny ants,</l><l>Remember, remember,</l><l>Remember God made you.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
